-- A program defined two layers down: `Demo` is in `base`, a platform the
-- project's own platform layer is built on, itself on `browser-inline`
-- (docs/design/browser-inline.md §8.3, amended 2026-10-19). The pass reads
-- both layers' modules as the program's own code, so each key's pass calls
-- the bindings its write reaches.
import Browser
import Demo
import Tea


main : Tea.Program
main = Browser.mountAt Demo.demo "root"
